        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not be mismated with unbelievers. For what partnership have righteousness and iniquity? Or what fellowship has light with darkness? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What accord has Christ with Belial?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6.15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Greek",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Beliar",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Or what has a believer in common with an unbeliever? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
